+/*
+ * ZCU104 ADI DMA historical changelog/TODO notes were moved out of this
+ * source file to keep driver code focused and maintainable.
+ *
+ * See: kernel_boot/boards/zcu104_fmcs2/docs/extended/ADI_DMA_DEBUGGING.md
+ * Use function names and file paths for anchors; avoid line-number anchors.
